{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "61a82961-2c77-50bb-a2d0-48f4d955e70a", "source_ordinal": 920, "reading_ordinal": 3137, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "艺术短板", "published_at": "2025-03-05T15:04:23.990000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/13038923577/answer/116968592555"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国的文化艺术缺的最关键一环到底是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "艺术是一出三角色剧，艺术家、评论家和观众。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "与一般想象的不同——中国最不缺的，其实恰恰是艺术家。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而最缺的也不是观众，而是评论家。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我们缺一个拥有自己的完整美学逻辑，足以评估和兼容现有西方美学成就，而又能指引中国艺术发展的评价体系。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "艺术批评的缺位，导致中国艺术长期受到西方艺术批评和所谓“大众审美”的双重撕扯。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "前者是异质的、离题的，因为西方艺术体系在根本上是围绕基督教和非基督教的二元轮转，中国艺术根本不能被纳入这个系统来评价，而如果一定要纳入，仅仅不过是被视为“殖民地风情”那样，被当作另一种“日本风味”、异国情调。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在某种意义上，西方艺术批评还常有本能的傲慢和霸权意识——ta们从未为了正确评价中国艺术而尝试真正理解中国文化。勉强会这么做的，往往是为地缘政治理由、为外交政策服务的汉学家群体——典型的如外交官出身的高罗佩。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta们宁可——或者说满足于——作为一个不懂中文、不识汉典、不知国史的技术性专家用欧洲的语言谈论中国艺术的“纯美学属性”。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta们关注且高度评价的艺术家，往往是根正苗红、血统可查的西方艺术体系培养出来、用西方艺术理论关注所谓“中国议题”的“华人西方艺术家”。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "并且那些所谓的议题，还常常不自觉地服务于西方的普遍价值观和国际秩序愿景。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而两极的另一极——即中国的“大众审美”——则因为美学教育被两百年国运巨变活生生撕裂而处在一个狂暴、迷乱、混淆的空有强烈欲望和情绪、几无连贯理由甚至清晰口齿的阶段。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个声音随着具体人群的不同会发出令艺术家茫然无措却又难以理解、更遑论认同的奇谈怪论，往往——甚至总是到最后被强烈的情绪激荡引向所谓的“反美”“反西方”的有破无立的方向。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而中国的艺术家站在中间，不知道自己到底是要跟着“人民”走，还是要跟着西方的前辈走。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这个问题，几乎在所有的艺术门类里都存在，其严重性远超过各个工程、技术、军事、经济领域。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为那些自然科学领域的发展不依赖权威，而艺术领域里引领派别和潮流的领军人物却有灵魂一般的关键作用。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "只不过这种关键作用不是以创作作品的形式，而是以艺术批评的形式。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "要说努力，需要有足够的人自觉的看见这个时代的召唤，甘于将自己的才智和人生投入到严肃的艺术批评这项事业中去。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "只有有了能与西方分庭抗礼的艺术批评，才能有与西方分庭抗礼的艺术创作和艺术欣赏，才有中国艺术的重新崛起。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这才是中国艺术的短板。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1005}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有志于在服装设计领域形成中国的文化自信，创立中国的世界性服装设计品牌，应该在哪些方面努力？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“艺术短板”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国的文化艺术缺的最关键一环到底是什么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国的文化艺术缺的最关键一环到底是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6afba5ac-74ea-54a3-aca4-c67333662d54", "source_ordinal": 919, "reading_ordinal": 3138, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无憾", "published_at": "2025-03-05T19:01:27.335000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/2a85254af90f11ef83b252540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "度就是“求极值”运算的结果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "举点具体的例子，提高单价可以提高单位利润但是却会降低销量，而你的总利润是单位利润和总销量的乘积。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这样列出公式，你就可以算出一个可以获得最大总利润的最佳的价格。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个最佳价格就是你的“度”。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要想算得出“度”，需要强大的数学建模能力，要善于发现各种要素和最终关键指标之间的影响关系。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "某种意义上讲，“人生游戏”被简化到极点可以被认为是几十个因素对几十个输出指标的数学模型，根据时空变化，每一时每一处都可以算出最佳的参数组合。考虑到管理成本，这些最佳的参数取值可以各自加上一定的宽容度来降低管理难度。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要获得这个能力，平时最好多学一些“定价策略”“最佳解决方案”这类的案例，多做分析。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "任何时候你做到了“此刻每个参数都在最佳取值的宽容度范围之内”，你会即时获得你能获得的人生所可能有的最佳收益——无憾。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "无憾者无畏。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "注意这跟你过去的欠债无关，跟你将来的结果也无关，而是此时此刻在度内，此时此刻即刻无憾，当下无畏。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "无畏是一个会计学和管理学的综合成就。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 440}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：凡事都有度，这个度怎么理解？怎么掌握？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“无憾”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“度就是“求极值”运算的结果。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "度就是“求极值”运算的结果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f4d7494f-c6db-5f1a-9e52-16c96036763d", "source_ordinal": 918, "reading_ordinal": 3139, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "冷字门", "published_at": "2025-03-07T07:07:30.774000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/cfa5f918fa3211efa8df5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "冷门专业本身可能不怎么样。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那么冷门专业 + 应用数学， 冷门专业 + 会计，冷门专业 + 计算机， 冷门专业 + 视觉传达，冷门专业 + 市场营销， 冷门专业 + 新闻……呢？", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "纯学数学、会计、计算机、视觉传达、市场营销、新闻……的人，可不会你这一门专业。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那意味着你这门专业的相关企业只要还招数学、会计、计算机、视觉传达、营销、新闻……的人，你都会排在前面，甚至是那些专业的高手也不一定争得赢你。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“冷门”是少有人走的道路，换言之，那也是少有人知的体验、少有人有的优势。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "别的不说，你没发现越冷门的专业直播越容易红吗？", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "最佳的安全策略，一向是富有竞争力的主流技能和少有竞争的专业方向的组合。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“冷门”已经帮你先凑齐了一半，而且是其他人很难赶上的那一半，你这是占了便宜了，只等你把另一半拼图补上，你就可以进入领奖台去看着那些“技能栈堆满但却不知道有什么可做”的程序员们纠结35岁危机了。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "偷着乐去吧你就。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 403}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：大学学的是一个冷门专业，不好就业，但我想有一个非常光明的未来。我该怎样做 今年大一？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“冷字门”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“冷门专业本身可能不怎么样。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "冷门专业本身可能不怎么样。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da69c41a-a1d1-5023-b1e5-30c9fdacd67b", "source_ordinal": 917, "reading_ordinal": 3140, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "最低社会性要求", "published_at": "2025-03-07T20:23:38.274000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/bc7b7d0afb4e11ef87a852540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "价值观不同，你一样可以做某种程度的来往。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "价值观不同，妨碍你吃清真牛肉面了吗？", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "价值观不同，妨碍你去宫观庙宇观光旅游了吗？", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "价值观不同，妨碍你看西方大片、日本动漫了吗？", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "社会生活里的绝大多数事务都是不需要以价值观相同为前提的，它们只需要遵守法律、遵循社会一般规则。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而仅仅这个“法律和规则”的层面都已经足够你安排人生80%的清醒时间了——其实你大部分的清醒时间都是在公共空间和价值观不明的人一起度过，这在现代几乎是注定的。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在再谈那些必须对价值观有所要求的活动——例如恋爱、婚姻、子女教育、家庭财务管理、以家庭名义进行的对外交往。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些亲密行为当然对价值观有要求，但要求的不是相同，而是相容。而相容不是指“我觉得你说得真对”，而是指“我很清楚什么事该你决定、什么事该我决定、什么事要基于什么规则来得出共同遵守的决定”，指的是一套安排有序、言而有信、行之有效的议事规则。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这才是很多人犯的根本错误。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为没有得到荣耀的议事规则来有效的推进公共事务，双方不得不不断的展开统治权战争，去争夺绝对话语权。在这种近乎残酷无情的你死我活的斗争中，双方对和平的渴望完全寄托在了“要是大家三观一致就好了”。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为理论上三观一致看法就会一致，就不用争夺话事权了嘛。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "然而这却是一个更危险和脆弱的幻想。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为世界上根本不存在两个三观完全一致（即兼容）的人。这就像你在河里随手摸了两块石头可以严丝合缝的拼到一起一样困难。即使有，人也是要发展、要变化的，谁能保证跟着实时变化？甲变乙未变、甲变蓝乙变黄要怎么办？", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "到时候意见又要不一致、又要争个你死我活，直到一边完全丧失或放弃争夺话语权。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以这根本是不可行的方法。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因此从一开始就不要对“三观一致”有过高的要求，要转而要求一些更基本的价值观要素，那些能保证双方的博弈和合作有效率的要素。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这一共只有两条——", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "1）live and let live——自己活，也让别人活。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这说的是体谅别人的能力。最好时时刻刻把“别人也要活”挂在嘴上、摆在脸上。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "很多时候有些人对“别人也要活”是严重缺乏概念的。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "举点例子，例如在博主的评论区留了长篇评论就暗自给对方加上了“必须回复我”的义务，不回复就要生气、要惩罚。", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "例如精心准备了礼物，女神就必须喜欢，如果不十分惊喜、百分感激，就要深感屈辱，言必称“看不起屌丝”。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "例如ta欣赏的东西就不允许别人不欣赏，ta认可的东西别人就不能不认可，否则就是“屁股坐歪了 / 夹带私货 / 脱离群众”。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这些看似是一种“日常的抱怨”，但实际上却已经是“不让别人活”级别的残酷。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为要消除ta的这种怨恨，意味着对方必须按照一种不可持续的规则生存。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1098}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "有人发了评论就必须得回，收了礼物必须加倍回报，这谁能办到？", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这种思维方式是万万不能沾边的，只有当事人自己在社会里遭遇无数的碰壁，足以让人相信ta已经毫无侥幸的明白了“这行不通”才行。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1190}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "注意，live and let live不是用来给以恶为业开脱的法则。因为你不能体谅“ta不贩毒 / 抢劫 / 诈骗就活不下去”这种活法，因为这时候已经是ta让不让别人活的问题了。", "char_start": 1191, "char_end": 1281}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这是铁门槛，迈不过去就不要给什么“磨合”的机会。", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1306}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你要当磨刀石，就要先想好——磨到最后剩下的是那把刀。", "char_start": 1307, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "2）说话算话。", "char_start": 1335, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "关于达成的共识，无论是什么结果，都要认账。", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1364}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "不怕你凶横霸道，也不怕你咄咄逼人，只怕你说话不算话。", "char_start": 1365, "char_end": 1391}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "说话算话不意味着你必须说到做到，但绝对包括你没做到的时候不能自认为“没什么大不了”。天有不测风云、人无自知之明，没做到很平常，但是没做到就是没做到，不能脖子一梗，反过来责怪别人“斤斤计较”。", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "如果你自己不为你的信用做完全的背书，那么和你达成任何共识都毫无意义。只有磨，哪有合？磨什么合？", "char_start": 1488, "char_end": 1535}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "只要满足这两个最低条件，其它的观点问题、审美问题、立场问题，都有可磨合的空间，都有磨合的可能。", "char_start": 1536, "char_end": 1583}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "注意，这不是说只要不是这两类问题你就一定要去磨或者一定能磨成功，这只是说超过这两根及格线，你才有最基本的通关这个游戏的概率可言。", "char_start": 1584, "char_end": 1648}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "因为这两条是“最低社会性要求”，低于这两根线，这人就已经不具备有效的社会性，而是已经成为了反社会人格。何止谈不了恋爱、交不了朋友，是走到哪里就在哪里无风起浪、空穴来风式的消耗社会性资源，将大量本可以产生价值的社会资源消耗到无穷尽却无意义的对ta的自激危机无限“救援”之中。", "char_start": 1649, "char_end": 1785}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "社会资源可以非常慷慨，例如花几十亿去做射电阵列寻找外星人，花上百亿去寻找暗物质，但绝不能拿来给人打水漂玩。", "char_start": 1786, "char_end": 1839}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "人一旦到了年纪还没有达成最低社会性要求，社会就别无选择、而且必然的开始用越来越彻底的放逐来作最后的教育。", "char_start": 1840, "char_end": 1892}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "谁自告奋勇要阻拦、妨碍社会这最后的放逐教育，谁就会成为这种反社会性最后的燃料。", "char_start": 1893, "char_end": 1932}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "那可真是舍身扑空。", "char_start": 1933, "char_end": 1942}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "切忌。", "char_start": 1943, "char_end": 1946}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 50}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：因为发现价值观不同就立刻说拜拜，而不去尝试磨合是对的吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“最低社会性要求”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“价值观不同，你一样可以做某种程度的来往。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "价值观不同，你一样可以做某种程度的来往。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "eb729eb5-5438-5d41-a8a7-8fc1ce63e38a", "source_ordinal": 916, "reading_ordinal": 3141, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "三宅一生", "published_at": "2025-03-07T23:02:42.534000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/8250757615/answer/119034376245"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果是恶意，就没有微小的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "举点例子，某个流氓拦路调戏你，只是摸了一把脸，轻微伤都没有，这就算微小的恶意吗？", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有人闯入你家里，只偷了一双鞋，金额很小，这算微小的恶意吗？", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有人造你的谣，虽然没有造成什么实际后果，这算微小的恶意吗？", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有人朝你开了一枪，但是只擦破点油皮，这算微小的恶意吗？", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "有人去庙里祷告“希望ta短命”，你甚至都没啥感觉，这算微小的恶意吗？", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "恶意，意思是这人已经亮明了敌人、恶人的身份。要害在于这个人的实力有多大，而不是头几次遭遇战损失多不多。哪怕一次边境冲突打过来的炮弹没有造成严重死伤，难道可以当“小小误会”拍拍屁股算了？", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "即使只死了几个人，战争行为依然是战争行为，没有因为死的人少可以看成小事的说法。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "能算大小的，只有不含恶意的过失。有恶意，那么其大小就只能决定反制手段的规模和力度，而不能取消“采取手段管控其风险”的必要性。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，只要是恶意，就没有“算了”这一说，最轻的手段也是疏远和隔离。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果威胁严重，就有必要给予对方足以刻骨铭心、不敢再起同样的妄念的清晰信号。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所谓的宽容，是指对方事后“九死一生”的惊恐里你给ta留的那“一生”。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ta要感受到九死一生，而且要认识到“如果再来一次，就算宅在家里，隔着三进院子，这‘一生’也不见得保得住”。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不必手软，不要给ta留下侥幸，这是救ta的命，因为下一个第一轮报复就未必会给ta留这一线生机。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "对应的，只有无心之失、无恶意的冒犯可以获得宽容，可以有“不计较”这样的待遇。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果你有仁慈的冲动，你可以主动的铺台阶，引导对方声明“无恶意”自辨——比如你直接问对方“你这是不是故意的”，九成九人都懂得抓住机会脱离接触。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果ta其实是恶意的，被你直捣黄龙不得不当众自承“没有恶意”，ta就已经知道事不可为，而周围观众已经明白ta这是认输投降了。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "那就没有必要走到动用武力反制的那一步。", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这就是慈悲了。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而这样做有一个前提，那就是你需要有仁名在外，对动用武力有已知的、可信的克制原则，而不是凶名在外、身背几条人命那种，否则你一旦让对方觉得切实的得罪了你、处在要迎接你的报复的状态，对方就会因为你的残暴记录诱发过度极端的应激反应——例如对方在恐惧想象的驱使下为完全不成比例的过失被迫来跟你同归于尽，或者更坏——陷入绝望而畏罪自杀。", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你有仁名在外，发出武力信号才会驱使对方产生急切的修和冲动而不是因为对修和绝望而只能做困兽之斗。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "所以，只有仁慈的人，才能真正放下顾忌的发挥自己的强大武力去反制冒犯，暴虐的人反而不能。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1041}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "Alas! Yet another poetic irony.", "char_start": 1042, "char_end": 1073}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何处理他人的微小的恶意？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“三宅一生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果是恶意，就没有微小的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果是恶意，就没有微小的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5cd5f4e5-ebea-56ea-9022-98d426908e94", "source_ordinal": 915, "reading_ordinal": 3142, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "俯就", "published_at": "2025-03-08T00:43:23.073000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/663873960/answer/119081613269"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "男性向下兼容？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "投学校的时候向下兼容了吗？谁在拣着“目标水准降一等”的学校申请？", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "找工作的时候向下兼容了吗？谁在找个比自己low的工作？", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "发现规律了吗？", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一把手找二把手，向下兼容；二把手找一把手，向上择优。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而什么决定谁是二把手，谁是一把手？", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不是看才能，而是看生产资料掌握在谁手里。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这种所谓的“性别文化差异”，本质上不过是性别的历史性不平等的惯性延续罢了。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "之前男性掌握了社会财富，自然习惯了以一把手、老板的身份去挑选“员工”，而女性总是以穷到连银行账户都没法独立开设的身份去“求职”。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这就是这事背后的秘密。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 257}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么男性向下兼容，女性向上择优？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“俯就”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“男性向下兼容？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "男性向下兼容？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da61c2b9-b5fa-5ac5-b0aa-cfd9c56b6e8b", "source_ordinal": 914, "reading_ordinal": 3143, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "endless worrier", "published_at": "2025-03-09T08:23:00.656000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648656723/answer/119879454234"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为母亲总是那个最没安全感的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "出于历史文化和生理原因，男性的耐伤害能力、逃脱能力、对抗能力、默认占有的社会资源都远胜于女性。同样的风险，对男性而言可以被总结为“伤疤就是勋章”，对女性却可以被总结为“破了相将来难嫁人”。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一旦风险降临，女性往往是打不过、逃不掉、伤不起的，所以她们全部的策略关注都放在了侦查和回避上。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "她们的嗅觉、听觉甚至视觉都要远远的比男性强，这个将来男性们有很多机会可以在实际生活中体会。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这甚至是女司机容易应对失当的原因之一——女司机很容易高估风险，在过早的时机就开始陷入过于激烈的逃避反应——例如拼命的乱打方向盘或者猛踩刹车。结果反而一旦踩错油门就会是非常猛烈的加速，陷入急剧的恶性循环而出事。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "三口之家，小孩子少年不知愁滋味，父亲焦虑水平低，当然最先焦虑的总是母亲。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "客观现实如此，暂时无法可想。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 362}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么很多家庭里扫兴的都是妈妈？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“endless worrier”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为母亲总是那个最没安全感的人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为母亲总是那个最没安全感的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7892dffe-5880-5ff5-9b50-d6e35a827662", "source_ordinal": 913, "reading_ordinal": 3144, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "爱的野心", "published_at": "2025-03-09T08:27:21.580000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/13681458795/answer/119881213158"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "爱无野心，是指利己的野心，例如企图统治世界。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "爱有野心，是指利他的野心，例如立志消灭贫穷。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 45}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0454"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“爱无野心”，但是感觉您似乎认可人有野心，请问怎么理解“爱无野心”这句话呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002"], "summary": "围绕“爱的野心”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“爱无野心，是指利己的野心，例如企图统治世界。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "爱无野心，是指利己的野心，例如企图统治世界。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
